# Optional. Copy to .env (git-ignored); `make run` passes these to the container when set.
#
# `make run` (Docker replay) needs NONE of them: it replays the recorded outputs of the local
# models from data/ and serves the console. No network, no GPU, no API key.
#
# Live mode (host only, Apple Silicon) can point to a local OpenAI-compatible server serving Apertus,
# for example:  .venv/bin/mlx_lm.server --model <path-to-apertus-mlx> --port 8080
#   LLM_NAME=swiss-ai/Apertus-v1.5-8B
#   LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/v1
#   LLM_API_KEY=not-needed-for-a-local-server
LLM_NAME=
LLM_BASE_URL=
LLM_API_KEY=
